# Google check (REDUCD)

When the user says **"doe de google check"** (or similar), audit everything Google-related and report status + open actions. Do not skip open items.

## Always include

### Search / SEO
- Search Console: verification meta present, sitemap submitted, indexing / coverage issues
- `sitemap.xml`, `robots.txt`, canonicals, OG tags
- Key URLs: home, `/blog/`, `/pro/`, privacy

### Analytics & ads
- `js/tracking-config.js`: GA4 (`G-…`), Meta Pixel, **Google Ads (`AW-…`) + conversion label**
- **OPEN until done:** user must still connect Google Ads tag + map `generate_lead` / Ads `conversion` as conversions in Google Ads
- Cookie consent gates trackers (`js/tracking.js`)
- Events: `generate_lead` (contact form, lead popup, pro form), `contact`, `popup_open`, Ads `conversion` when label set
- Lead popup: `js/lead-popup.js` (timer / scroll / exit-intent)

### Technical / content
- LocalBusiness / AggregateRating / other JSON-LD
- Broken links, heavy assets, console tracking errors if inspectable

## Response format
- Short verdict (OK / gaps)
- Checklist with ✅ / ⚠️ / ❌
- Explicit reminder if Ads ID/label still PLACEHOLDER
